== Key figures ==

* [[Teresa Margall i Pons]] — founder of the Balboan Women's Civic Association (1968), plaintiff in ''Margall v. Sant Cristòfor Municipal Credit Union'' (1978), early advocate for sex-based constitutional protections
* [[Núria Salvà i Bauzà]] — president of the Union of Cooperative Women (1981–1990), plaintiff in ''Salvà v. Grup Llibertat'' (1983), organiser of the 1984 National Women's March, key figure in the rural women's movement
* [[Caterina Vives i Rosell]] — BPP member of the National Assembly (Jala–Sant Bart), introduced the Constitutional Amendment on Sex-Based Discrimination in 1985
* [[Montserrat Reig i Font]] — teacher in Nurra Province, plaintiff in ''Reig v. Ministry of Education'' (1990), whose case established the first application of the 1986 amendment to employment discrimination
* [[Roser Muntaner i Ferrer]] — first woman President of Balboa (1983–1993, BPP), championed the Constitutional Amendment on Sex-Based Discrimination during her presidency
